OL,3,ARussian strikes leave 600,000 without
OL,4,Apower in Ukraine, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 600,000 people across Ukraine
OL,7,Fare now without electricity after
OL,8,Fdeadly overnight Russian missile and
OL,9,Fdrone strikes, President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky has said.
OL,12,FHe said "critical" energy
OL,13,Finfrastructure had been hit in Kyiv and
OL,14,Fthe capital region and also in the
OL,15,Fnorth-eastern city of Kharkiv - despite
OL,16,Fa claim by US President Donald Trump on
OL,17,FSunday that an "energy ceasefire" was
OL,18,Fin place between Russia and Ukraine.
OL,20,FIn Kyiv, at least three people were
OL,21,Fkilled and 21 injured, Ukraine's state
OL,22,Femergencies service DSNS said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
