OL,3,ARussian strikes leave 600,000 without
OL,4,Apower in Ukraine, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia's defence ministry said its
OL,7,F"massive" strikes overnight had
OL,8,Ftargeted communications and energy
OL,9,Ffacilities in the Kyiv and Kharkiv
OL,10,Fregions used by Ukraine's military.
